2 CONT
2 CONT ==Descendant Details==
2 CONT i. THOMAS2 BURNHAM, JR., b. April 16, 1646, Hartford, Poduck, Connecticut; d. March 19, 1725/26, Hartford, Poduck, Connecticut. 
2 CONT ii. WILLIAM BURNHAM, b. 1652, Hartford, Poduck, Connecticut; d. December 12, 1730, Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut. 
2 CONT iii. LIEUT. RICHARD BURNHAM, b. 1654, Hartford, Poduck, Connecticut; d. April 28, 1731, Hartford, Poduck, Connecticut. 
2 CONT iv. ELIZABETH BURNHAM, b. 1640, Hartford, Poduck, Connecticut; d. 1720, Hartford, Poduck, Connecticut; m. UNK MOORCOCKE. 
2 CONT v. MARY BURNHAM, b. 1642, Hartford, Poduck, Connecticut; d. January 25, 1719/20, Windsor, Connecticut. 
2 CONT vi. ANNE (HANNAH) BURNHAM, b. 1644, Hartford, Poduck, Connecticut; d. November 29, 1722, Hartford, Poduck, Connecticut. 
