2 CONT
2 CONT ==Notes==
2 CONT Errantly seen as husband of https://www.geni.com/people/Anna-Gaines/6000000203613524822 
2 CONT No legitimate source proves the names of Thomas' parents.  'Date and place of birth have also been erroneously reported to be circa 1610 in Connecticut.  Place of marriage has also been (erroneously?) reported to be England.  Date
2 CONC  and place of death have also been (erroneously?) reported to be the following:
2 CONT * June 24, 1688 at Ipswich, Essex County, Massachusetts
2 CONT * June 28, 1688 at Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut
2 CONT * July 24, 1688 at an unidentified location
2 CONT
2 CONT Place of burial has also been (erroneously?) reported to be Ipswich, Essex County, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT THIS THOMAS BURNHAM IS NOT THE SON OF ROBERT BURNHAM AND MARY ANDREWS, THEIR SON THOMAS CAME OVER WITH HIS BROTHERS ON THE 'ANGEL GABRIEL' IN 1635, AND MARRIED MARY TUTTLE. I HAVE FOUND NO INFORMATION ON THE PARENTS NAMES OF THIS 
2 CONC THOMAS, BUT THERE ARE SEVERAL SOURCES THAT LIST THOMAS WHO MARRIED MARY TUTTLE AS THE SON OF ROBERT BURNHAM AND MARY ANDREWS.
2 CONT
2 CONT Probable daughter in 1620. prob Ann Wright was born circa 1622. She was the daughter of Richard Wright and Margaret, his first wife.  Prob Ann Wright married Thomas Burnham? before 1645, if correct, this Ann Wright did not emigrat
2 CONC e to America; she lived and died in England.
2 CONT
