2 CONT ===Samuel Burnham===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 1650 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Thomas Burnham Sr and Anna (Wright) Burnham
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Mary (Burnham) Morton, Anna Hannah (Burnham) Gaines, Thomas Burnham II, John Burnham, Samuel Burnham, William Burnham Sr., Rebecca (Burnham) Mann, Richard Burnham and Ame (Burnham) Moricock
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Mary (Cadwell) Diggins — married 8 Oct 1684 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Hannah (Burnham) Drake, Rebecca Burnham, Anna (Burnham) Trumbull, Mary (Burnham) Church, Samuel Burnham, Joseph Burnham, William Burnham, David Daniel Burnham, Timothy Burnham and Amy (Burnham) Filer
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 12 Apr 1728 at about age 78 in Hartford, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
