2 CONT THOMAS2 BURNHAM, JR. (THOMAS1) was born April 16, 1646 in Hartford, Poduck, Connecticut, and died March 19, 1725/26 in Hartford, Poduck, Connecticut.  He married NAOMI HULL January 04, 1675/76 in Connecticut, daughter of JOSIAH HU
2 CONC LL and ELIZABETH LOOMIS.  She was born February 17, 1656/57 in Connecticut, and died March 15, 1726/27 in Connecticut. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for THOMAS BURNHAM, JR.: 
2 CONT
2 CONT (II)   Thomas   (2),   son   of   Thomas   (i)Burnham, was born in 1646, and married, January 4, 1676, Naomi, daughter of Josiah Hull 
2 CONT
2 CONT of Killingworth.   She was born February 17,1657-58, in Windsor,  Connecticut, and died March 15, 1727-28.   Her father was deputy to 
2 CONT
2 CONT the general court from Windsor 1659-60-62, and   from   Killingworth,   1667-74.    Thomas Burnham died March 19, 1726-27.    His will 
2 CONT
2 CONT was dated March  15, 1726, and offered for probate April 5, by his son Charles, his executor.    It was allowed to stand good, November, 1726.    Children:   Thomas, mentioned below; John, May 22, 1681; Elizabeth. June 4,  1684;  
2 CONC Sarah,   March 7,  1687-88; Naomi, 
2 CONT
2 CONT June 3, 168S; Charles, May 16, 1690; Mary, July 12, 1692; Abigail, March 25, 1694; Josiah. September 6, 1696. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for NAOMI HULL: 
2 CONT
