1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =William Burnham=
2 CONT * BIRTH 1652 Hartford, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 12 Dec 1730 (aged 77–78) Wethersfield, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Wethersfield Village Cemetery, Wethersfield, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID  89441092 Photo added by dmiller & C. E. Tabbert
2 CONT
2 CONT William Burnham was the son of Thomas Burnham and Anna Wright.  He was Constable in 1692. Belonged to one of the most respected families of Wethersfield. He drew land in 1694 and received other land by deed of gift from his father
2 CONC . 
