1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Burnham-193
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Burnham was baptized 19 Dec 1690 in Hartford, Hartford, CT., dau of John and Mary Burnham.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married first to Stephen Webster in Hartford on 6 Jun 1717.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children were
2 CONT
2 CONT #Isaac Webster. He married Ame White at Hartford on November 11, 1739
2 CONT #Mary Webster
2 CONT #Timothy Webster. He married Sarah (Sary) White in 1745
2 CONT
2 CONT On 7 Apr 1730 Mary Webster, widow of Stephen Webster appointed guardian of her three children, Isaac aged 11 yrs, Mary aged 9 yrs, Timothy aged 7 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married second on 9 Apr 1730 to Ebenezer Merrill, son of John & Sarah (Marsh) Merrill as his second wife
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.jmerrill.net/
2 CONT
2 CONT 69. EBENEZER9 MERRILL (JOHN8 *MERRILL, JOHN7, NATHANIEL6, NATHANIEL5, JOHN4 *MERRELL, THE YOUNGER, JOHN3 *MERYELL, JOHN2, THOMAS1) was born December 18, 1698 in Hartford, Hartford, Conn, and died 1789 in Hartford, New Hartford, Co
2 CONC nn. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married MARY BURNHAM WEBSTER April 9, 1730 in Hartford, Hartford, Conn, daughter of JOHN BURNHAM and MARY OLCOTT. She was born Bef. December 19, 1690 in West Hartford, Hartford, Conn, and died Unknown in New Hartford, Litchfiel
2 CONC d, Conn.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of EBENEZER MERRILL and MARY WEBSTER are:
2 CONT
2 CONT *i. HANNAH10 MERRILL, b. Bef. November 10, 1728, West Hartford, Hartford, Conn; d. November 30, 1770, Hartford, Hartford, Conn; m. JOHN WALLIN, 1758; b. Bef. 1728; d. Unknown.Notes for HANNAH MERRILL: Perhaps married a John Wallin
2 CONC .
2 CONT *ii. AMY MERRILL, b. Bef. April 25, 1731, West Hartford, Hartford, Conn; d. Unknown, Wethersfield, Hartford, Conn; m. JUSTUS STEADMAN, April 27, 1756, Wethersfield, Hartford, Conn; b. Abt. 1729; d. Unknown. 
2 CONT *iii. SARAH MERRILL, b. Bef. August 31, 1735, West Hartford, Hartford, Conn; d. Unknown; m. (1) SAMUEL MERRILL; b. Bef. June 25, 1732, West Hartford, Hartford, Conn; d. March 30, 1798, New Hartford, Litchfield, Conn; m. (2) JOHN S
2 CONC TEELE, JR; b. Abt. 1735; d. Unknown; m. (3) MOSES MARSH, Abt. 1774; b. 1731, Hartford, Hartford, Conn; d. Unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Uncertain Mother 
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Burnham-193
2 CONT
2 CONT Some secondary sources state her father married Mary Catlin, other say her mother was Mary Olcott.  Who did John Burnham-405 [1652-1721] marr circa 1684 ? Mary CATLIN or Mary OLCOTT ?
