2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Samuel Burnham and Mary (Cadwell) Diggins - NO, Mary Fitch 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Mary Diggins [half], Jeremiah Diggins Jr. [half], Elizabeth (Diggins) Strickland [half], Thomas Diggins [half], Hannah (Burnham) Drake, Rebecca Burnham, Hannah (Diggins) Judd [half], Mary (Burnham) Church, Abigail (Diggi
2 CONC ns) Stearns [half], Samuel Burnham, Joseph Burnham, William Burnham, David Daniel Burnham, Timothy Burnham and Amy (Burnham) Filer
