2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Ammi (Trumbull) Trumble Jr., Anne (Trumbull) Watson and Mary (Trumbull) Hayden
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 10 Aug 1753 at age 62 in East Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
