2 CONT ===Hannah Burnham
2 CONT * Baptized 2 Jan 1686 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut 
2 CONT *Died 10 Oct 1764 at about age 79 in South Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT *Daughter of Samuel & Mary (Caldwell) Burnham 
2 CONT *Spouse:Jeremiah Drake - married 17 Oct 1717 in South Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah Burnham married Jeremiah Drake, son of Job Drake and Elizabeth Alvord, at Windsor, Hartford Co., Connecticut, on 9 October 1717?3
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah Burnham was living on 15 November 1746.2
2 CONT
2 CONT Family: Jeremiah Drake b. 11 Sep 1684, d. 28 Nov 1746
2 CONT
