2 CONT # Ann Drake b. 2 Sep 1722
2 CONT # Amee Drake b. 22 Sep 1724
2 CONT # Job Drake b. 1 Feb 1725/26, d. 30 Oct 1756
2 CONT # Marcus Drake b. 13 Jan 1727/28
2 CONT # Gideon Drake b. 31 Aug 1729, d. 20 Aug 1771
