2 CONT
2 CONT === Ann Morton1
2 CONT * F, b. circa 1679, d. 28 August 1716
2 CONT * Father: William Morton2
2 CONT * Mother: Mary Burnham2 b. 1642, d. 25 Jan 1720
2 CONT * Charts: John Drake of Windsor, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann Morton was born circa 1679.3 She married Joseph Drake, son of John Drake and Hannah Moore, at Windsor, Hartford Co., Connecticut, circa 1696.1 Ann Morton died on 28 August 1716 at Windsor, Hartford Co., Connecticut.2,4
2 CONT
2 CONT Family: Joseph Drake b. 26 Jun 1674, d. 14 Jan 1754
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 
2 CONT # Joseph Drake+ b. 24 Apr 1697, d. 12 Dec 1727
2 CONT # Benjamin Drake b. 14 Apr 1699
2 CONT # Ann Drake b. 30 Jan 1701
2 CONT # John Drake b. 6 May 1703
2 CONT # William Drake+ b. 30 Dec 1705, d. bt 23 Sep 1765 - 28 Apr 1767
2 CONT # Thomas Drake+ b. 18 May 1708, d. 10 Mar 1780
2 CONT # David Drake5 b. c 1710, d. 18 Mar 1793
2 CONT # Abell Drake5 b. 24 Mar 1710/11, d. 8 Aug 1747
2 CONT # Moses Drake b. 20 Jul 1716, d. 1744
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Comments
2 CONT
2 CONT Date and place of birth have also been (erroneously?) reported to be circa 1679 (at least one database specifies 1678) at Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT Place of death has also been (erroneously?) reported to be Hartford, Hartford County, Connecticut.
2 CONT
