1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lois Burnham, daughter of Capt. Michael Burnham and Lois (Wise) Burnham, was baptized 23 February 1729. She had six siblings: Elizabeth, James, Michael, Ashbel, Elisha and Lois.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lois married Joseph Allen Esq, son of Joseph and Mary (Hulet) Allen. They had ten known children, all born in East Windsor, CT: 1. Lois Allen, born 13 September 1751, married Simeon Barber. 2. Joseph Allen, born 21 August 1753, di
2 CONC ed 12 October 1757. 3. Asenath Allen, born 17 February 1756, married Edward Chapin and later Eldad Parsons, Esq. 4. Eunice Allen, born 18 March 1758, married James Burnham. 5. Hannah Allen, born 2 March 1760, married Roswell Prior
2 CONC . 6. Joseph Allen, born 23 March 1762, married Lucy Chapin. 7. Benjamin Allen, born 19 June 1764, married Miriam Thompson. 8. Asher Allen, Esq, born 22 September 1766, married Chloe Moody. 9. Anna Allen, born 9 March 1769, married
2 CONC  James Thompson. 10. Henry Allen, born 18 March 1771, married Mary Wells.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lois (Burnham) Allen died 6 December 1805 in East Windsor, CT and was buried in Scantic Cemetery.
