1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:F7W4-Z3D?lang=en
2 CONT
2 CONT Name	Polly Pratt
2 CONT Sex	Female
2 CONT Father's Name	Rusel Pratt
2 CONT Mother's Name	Anne
2 CONT Event Type	Birth
2 CONT Event Date	12 May 1775
2 CONT Event Place	Somers, Hartford, Connecticut, British Colonial America
2 CONT Event Place (Original)	Somers Twp, Tolland, Conneticut
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT First son named Peter after his father. 
2 CONT Second son named John after father's father.
2 CONT Third son named Russell after Polly's father.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Hanchett/4312492891360038125?through=6000000042041291819, daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Jacob-Pratt-Jr/6000000042041563794?through=6000000042041291819 & https://www.geni.c
2 CONC om/people/Mary-Pratt/6000000204239764865?through=6000000042041291819.  
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT We have a birth record of a daughter of Jacob and Mary named Polly born Dec. 14, 1774 in Somers. CT.  As many sources suggest, the Polly born in 1774 to Jacob and Mary probably died by 1776, and Polly b 1777 was named after her, a
2 CONC s was the custom when a child died.
2 CONT
2 CONT Onendaga, NY's 1850 and 1860 censuses have a Polly Hanchett ages 73 and 83 respectively, so born in 1776 or 1777, depending on the birth month. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Most likely https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Hanchett/4312492891360038125 is the daughter of Jacob and Mary, since several of her siblings (Jacob, Noah, Abner) also moved to Pompey, Onendaga, NY 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/details/PSTF-KM2
2 CONT under "Brief Life History."
2 CONT
2 CONT Records of Marilda Pratt Elvidge:
2 CONT
2 CONT Family records show there are two Polly Pratts, not 3.
2 CONT Polly Pratt #1 died at age 2 Born: 16 Dec 1774  D: 2 Dec. 1776
2 CONT Polly Pratt #2, married to Joseph Thompson...Born: 4 June 1777  Died: 4 March 1868
2 CONT
2 CONT This Polly Pratt does not appear in any of our family records.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Pratt-13715
2 CONT
2 CONT Lists both Joseph Hanchett and Peter Smith as husbands of a Polly Pratt. But birth records of their children show these men, who both married a Mary or Polly Pratt, shown as daughters of Jacob Pratt and Mary Cooley Pratt, were hav
2 CONC ing children in the same time period.  Mary Hanchett's children were born in NY. Polly Smith's children were born in Somers, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
