1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lois Allen Barber
2 CONT BIRTH 13 Sep 1751 East Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT DEATH 29 Jul 1814 (aged 62) East Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT BURIAL Scantic Cemetery, East Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT MEMORIAL ID 127814189 Photos by msimonds
2 CONT
2 CONT Lois Allen, daughter of Joseph and Lois (Burnham) Allen was born 13 September 1751 in East Windsor, CT. She had nine siblings: Joseph (21 August 1753 - 12 October 1787), Asenath, Eunice, Hannah, Joseph, Benjamin, Asher, Anna and H
2 CONC enry.  On 26 September 1771, in East Windsor, she married Simeon Barber, son of Jonathan and Rachel (Gaylord) Barber. They had five children, all born in East Windsor, CT, at the age of 63 Lois died, 29 July 1814, in East Windsor.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Inscription'''
2 CONT In MEMORY of
2 CONT Mrs. Lois wife of Mr.
2 CONT Simeon Barber who died
2 CONT very suddenly on the 29th
2 CONT July 1814 in the 63 year 
2 CONT of Her age. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Watch therefore for ye
2 CONT know not what hour
2 CONT your Lord doth come.''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Joseph Allen 1727–1808
2 CONT Lois Burnham Allen 1729–1805
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT Simeon Barber 1741–1808 m. 9/26/1771
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT Eunice Allen Burnham 1758–1839
2 CONT Joseph Allen 1762–1822
2 CONT Benjamin Allen 1764–1808
2 CONT Asher Allen 1766–1825
2 CONT Anna Allen Thompson 1769–1852
2 CONT Henry Allen 1771–1809
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''' 5x all b. East Windsor, CT
2 CONT Cynthia Barber Osborne 10/20/1772–1837 m. Ebenezer Osborn.
2 CONT Simeon Barber 3/17/1774–1847 m. Martha Potwine.
2 CONT Lois Barber Richardson 10/16/1775–1806 m.Alexander Richardson
2 CONT Rachel Barber 9/25/1781–1854 unmarried
2 CONT Hadassah Barber 12/22/1784–1864 unmarried
2 CONT
