1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Anna Allen Thompson=
2 CONT * BIRTH 9 Mar 1769 East Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 23 Nov 1852 (aged 83) Rockville, Tolland County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL North Coventry Cemetery, Coventry, Tolland County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 18064857 
2 CONT
2 CONT When Anna Allen was born on 9 March 1769, in East Windsor, Connecticut, her father, Joseph Allen, Esq, was 41 and her mother, Lois (Burnham) Allen, was 41. She had nine siblings: Lois Allen (married Simeon Barber), Joseph Allen (1
2 CONC 753 – 1757), Asenath Allen (married Edward Chapin and later Eldad Parsons), Eunice Allen (married James Burnham), Hannah Allen (married Roswell Prior), Joseph Allen (married Lucy Chapin), Benjamin Allen (married Miriam Thompson), 
2 CONC Asher Allen (married Chloe Moody) and Henry Allen (married Mary Wells).
2 CONT
2 CONT On 25 February 1789, in East Hartford, CT, Anna married James Thompson, son of John and Bilhah (Terry) Thompson. They had nine children in 19 years. She died on 23 November 1852, in Rockville, Connecticut, at age 83 years, and was
2 CONC  buried in North Coventry Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT See husband James Thompson memorial for details regarding the nine children.
2 CONT
