2 CONT
2 CONT The son of Caleb & Martha (Cadwell) Bull, he died in Litchfield, Conn. at age 51. He married (1) Mary Hart on Feb. 26, 1770, (2) Ursula (Bull) Philips, widow of ___ Philips, and (3) Gamaliel (Bull) Painter, daughter of Isaac & Eun
2 CONC ice (Gillett) Bull. He had no children.
