2 CONT D/O Josiah Burnham(1710-1800) & Ruth Norton(1724-1762). W/O Benjamin Hall, Esq.(1735-1786). They were married 16 Apr 1767 • Farmington-Berlin, Hartford, Connecticut, United States and were parents of: Abigail William Hall(1768-184
2 CONC 3), Ruth Hall(1770-1841), Benjamin Hall(1772), William B Hall(1774-1842), Luranna 'Anna' (Nee Hall)Bullock(1776-1853), Avery Hall(1779-1858), Nancy Hall(1780), Stella Hall(1782) & Edmund Fanning Hall(1784-1864).
