1 NOTE {geni:about_me} A Patriot of the American Revolution for NEW YORK with the rank of ADJUTANT.  [https://services.dar.org/Public/DAR_Research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A090252  DAR Ancestor # A090252 ]
2 CONT
2 CONT (f/g) Timothy Sr. Phelps Birth: 	Jan. 25, 1747 Hadley Hampshire County Massachusetts, USA Death: 	Jul. 3, 1817 Marlboro Windham County Vermont, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT One of two known sons of Dorothy King Root and Charles Phelps. Settled at Marlboro in 1764 at the age of seventeen with his father, mother and older brother.
2 CONT
2 CONT They were one of the two first families settling the township. His father was a Massachusetts attorney.
2 CONT
2 CONT Timothy married a daughter of Eunice Wheeler and Captain Joseph Williams, Zipporah Williams, on 6 January 1775.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had three sons and two daughters. 
2 CONT
