2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription: This plat of ground, whose dust mingles with his, was among the first that felt his cultivating hand.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: The marker inscription quote was taken from : Gazetteer and Business Directory of Windham County, Vt., 1724-1884. Compiled and Published by Hamilton Child, Printed At The Journal Office, Syracuse, NY., July, 1884. Page 248-2
