2 CONT Vol 7 of "Griswold Family England and America," page 130 < [https://www.ancestry.com/mediaui-viewer/tree/18532983/person/1717272270/media/ad68aff0-ae4c-4921-a826-84f075f8eb32 AncestryImage] >
