1 NAME Samuel /Merrill/
2 GIVN Samuel
2 SURN Merrill
2 _MARNM Merrill
2 NICK Samuel MERRILLS
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 7 FEB 1801
2 ADDR
3 STAE Ontario
3 CTRY Canada
1 DEAT
2 DATE 13 JAN 1866
2 ADDR
3 STAE Ontario
3 CTRY Canada
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} According to Canadian family information, Samuel's wife was Phoebe Lothrop, he did not marry anyone surnamed Richardson, although another family member may have...  There are several Lothrop/Lotrip family members a
2 CONC t the Wicklow Baptist Church where Roger and family were members.  Also, a son, John Lothrop Merrill was listed in the 1851 Canadian census.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Also, the granddaughter, and daughter, Phoebe, was married to others, who will be listed later.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Nancy Merrill Sayed
