2 CONT Wife:	Mary Burnham (born Johnson)
2 CONT Children:	James Burnham, Catherine J Clayton (born Burnham), Mary Frances Barbour (born Burnham), Mosher Burnham, Josephine Burnham, George Burnham, Harriet Amelia Burnham, and names of 3 more children
2 CONT Siblings:	Lydia Burnham, Benjamin Burnham, Burrell Burnham, Betsey Burnham, Mary Cowdrey (born Burnham), Salome Burnham, Sarah Cowdrey (born Burnham), and names of 2 more siblings
