1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Ellen Savage Burnham'''
2 CONT
2 CONT The daughter of Michael Burnham and Elizabeth Seymour, she was born on September 2, 1818 in New York City and baptized on March 21, 1822 at South Dutch Church, New York City, New York. She was the wife of Cornelius Savage, whom sh
2 CONC e married on September 29, 1842 in Manhattan, New York, and mother of Cornelius and Henry Burnham Savage.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage - On September 29, 1842, Ellen Burnham married Cornelius Savage at the Washington Square Church in Manhattan, New York. Witnessed by Mrs. H. Russ and Mrs. E. Burnham.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1860, Cornelius Savage, aged 16, was living in Brooklyn, New York, in the home of his parents, Cornelius Savage, aged 50, and Ellen Savage, aged 41, with brother, Henry Savage, aged 8, servant, Ellen Degan, aged 20. His father 
2 CONC was shown to be a broker.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1865, Ellen B. Savage, aged 30, was living in Brooklyn, New York, with her husband, Cornelius Savage, aged 45, and son, Henry Savage, aged 12. Also living in the household was Kate Carson, aged 19. Her husband was shown to be e
2 CONC mployed in a government office.
2 CONT
2 CONT Obituary - Savage - On Tuesday night, of pneumonia, Mrs. Ellen Burnham Savage, widow of the late Cornelius Savage. Services at Grace Church, Brooklyn Heights, New York at 2 o'clock on Friday, 24th inst.
2 CONT
2 CONT Death Record - Ellen Burnham Savage, aged 58 widowed, lady, born 1818 in New York City, father born in Hartford, Conn., and mother in New York City, died on November 21, 1876 in Brooklyn, New York, and was buried on November 24, 1
2 CONC 876 in St. Mary's Cemetery, Rye, Westchester County, New York. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (Ellen Burnham in the U.S., Dutch Reformed Church Records in Selected States, 1639-1989; North America, Family Histories, 1500-2000 for Cornelius Savage, B, Burnham, Genealogical records of deacon John Burnham and his descendants;
2 CONC  Ellen Burnham in the U.S., Dutch Reformed Church Records in Selected States, 1639-1989; 1860 US Federal Census; 1865 New York State Census; The Brooklyn Daily Eagle (Brooklyn, New York), 22 Nov 1876, Wednesday, Page 3; New York, 
2 CONC New York City Municipal Deaths, 1795-1949, Reference ID cn 10897, GS Film Number 1323729; Ellen B Savage in the New York, New York, Extracted Death Index, 1862-1948, Certificate Number: 10897; U.S., Newspaper Extractions from the 
2 CONC Northeast, 1704-1930 for Ellen Burnham Savage, New York, New York Evening Post, Death, 1873-1875)
