2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Son of Joel Rockwell. Husband of Hannah Coon Rockwell. Father of Zerah and Bernard Rockwell.Ephraim was married first to Sarah Moore, July 1 1773. She was born about 1750, and died 1776 in childbirth.Sarah was the Mother of Allen 
2 CONC Rockwell. Source: Ancestry.com
2 CONT
