2 CONC 51915 · View Source SHARE  SAVE TOSUGGEST EDITS MEMORIAL PHOTOS 2 FLOWERS 0 1850 lived in Bureau, Illinois PHELPS Epaphras H Philips 37 Mary G Philips 35 Catharine M Philips 6 Mary E Philips 2 Ebenez F Philips 61 Anna Philips 59
2 CONT
2 CONT * Ebenezer Strong Phelps was born September 13, 1788 in Northampton, Hampshire County, Massachusetts. His parents were Nathaniel Phelps and Lucy Strong. He married Anna Wright on February 24, 1812 in Northampton. She was born May 
2 CONC 10, 1791 in Hadley, Hampshire County, Massachusetts, to Asahel and Rachel (Searle) Wright. Ebenezer Strong Phelps and his wife Anna had seven children, six of whom lived into adulthood, and five who survived their mother. They wer
2 CONC e: Epaphras, Charles, Ebenezer, James, Mary, Susan, Lucinda. Ebenezer died March 19, 1872 in Princeton. Anna died July 6, 1873, also in Princeton. Both are buried in Oakland Cemetery, Princeton, Illinois.
2 CONT * 
