1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/58425769/spencer-phelps
2 CONT
2 CONT Spencer Phelps BIRTH	24 May 1782 Chesterfield, Hampshire County, Massachusetts, USA DEATH	11 Sep 1865 (aged 83) Mentor, Lake County, Ohio, USA BURIAL	 Mentor Municipal Cemetery Mentor, Lake County, Ohio, USA PLOT	Section 3B Row 3 
2 CONC Stone 3 MEMORIAL ID	58425769 · View Source SHARE  SAVE TOSUGGEST EDITS MEMORIAL PHOTOS 3 FLOWERS 3
2 CONT
2 CONT Records associated with Spencer's birth date of 24 May 1782 actually show that his mother was Naomi Clark. She died in 1784, and Spencer's father Spencer Phelps remarried to Theodomy Allen. Because Spencer was only 2 when his moth
2 CONC er died, he was actually raised by Theodomy and she was all he remembered.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT From About the Phelps family of America and their English Ancestors... Page 519.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2383. Spencer Phelps, b. Chesterfield, Mass., 24 May, 1782, m. Mary Kenneippe, 1804. She was of Dutch descent and was born near Mt. Tom, Mass., 13 Dec 1784, d. Kirtland, Ohio, 22 April, 1851. Mr. Phelps settled in Northampton, whe
2 CONC re he resided up to 1807, when with his family he removed to Leroy, then to Kirtland, Ohio. He died at Mentor, Ohio, 11 Sept. 1865. He served in war of 1812. 
2 CONT
