2 CONC hter Isabelle Webster Terry (B-1/6/1878, D-10/11/1972) , later Mrs. Fred Stanton Fletcher, on horseback.  Picture was reprinted by Terry Bradley Fletcher (B-11/23/1934), grandson of Isabelle Webster (Terry) Fletcher on January 199
2 CONC 8 in Bristol, CT.
