2 CONC 845, D-7/7/1926) and Franklin's oldest daughter Isabelle Webster Terry (B-1/8/1878, D-10/11/1934), later Mrs. Fred Stanton Fletcher, on horseback.  Picture was reprinted by Terry Bradley Fletcher (B-11/23/1934), grandson of Isabel
