2 CONT SeeNotes - John B. Terry was removed from Lot 114, Section C of Spring Grove Cemetery  , Hartford, CT and was reinterred in the Cedar Hill Cemetery, Hartford, CT, Lot 81, Section 12 on 6/7/1978.  Undertaker: James T. Pratt Co..  H
2 CONC owever, states that John B. Terry was probably buried in Brooklyn, N.Y.  
