2 CONT Terry & Andrews Clock Factory owned by Theodore Terry (B-8/5/1808, D-6/18/1881).  Theodore Terry purchased the land in Bristol, CT from Samuel Terry (B-1/24/1774, 5/14/1873).  The factory was built on the ruins of the old Terry Fa
2 CONC ctory (owned by Samuel Terry) which was burned about 1840.  
2 CONT
