2 CONT On September 27, 1865, Grantor Theodore Terry of Holyoke, Massachusetts being now in Bristol, Connecticut executed a quitclaim deed to Grantee Johanna Blackburn, Widow of Daniel Blackburn of Bristol for one undivided eighth part o
2 CONC f a certain piece of land situate in Bristol. 
