2 CONC elonging to said Mix the right and privilege to enter upon the present route and location of said pipe from time to time for the purpose of mending and repairing said pipe or any part or portion thereof  and for the purpose of lay
2 CONC ing down and placing other or new pipe in line of present pipe. 
