2 CONC ol, do demise lease and to farm lot and by these presents have ----   -----   and to farm lotten unto the said Theodore Terry the following night and privilege - to wit - the sight and privilege to continue the leaden pipe as now 
2 CONC laid down and placed by the said Theodore Terry for the purpose of conducting water from a well which said Theodore Terry  has lately dug on the land of the said Samuel Terry, situated in said Bristol.  To this the said Theodore T
2 CONC erry’s dwelling house once the premisis around his the said Theodore’s said house with the right and privilege to enter upon the lands of the Lewis or on the road of said pipes from time to time for the purpose of mending and repa
2 CONC iring the said pipe or any part or portion thereof it also for the purpose of patching up said pipes or any portion thereof once laying down new or other pipes in the line thereof but whenever said Theodore Terry, his heir, or his
2 CONC  or ---- so enter ---- from the aforesaid write of said pipes for the purpose  aforesaid he or they shall pay to the Leapor his heirs or apigns so center upon the aforesaide write of saide pipe for the purpose aforesaid he or they
2 CONC  shall pay to the Leapor his heirs or apigns all reasonable once proper damages that may become to the land or to the crops therever being -”
