2 CONT “Know all men by these presents that I Ashabel Mix of Bristol in Hartford County, in and for the consideration of ten dollars receivable to my full satisfaction of Theodore Terry of Bristol, do demise lease and to farm lot once by
2 CONC  these presents have demised - leased and to farm letten, write the said Theodore Terry, his heirs, apigns the following nights and privileges, to wit - Whereas the said Theodore Terry has lately laid down and placed a leaden pipe
2 CONC  in the grounds atop a certain piece of land belonging to said  Mix situated in the 2nd tier lots in said Bristol for the assistance of about thirty rods be the same more or less which pipe conducts and conveys water from a founta
2 CONC in on lands of Samuel Terry unto the premisis of the said Theodore Terry - with the sight and privilege to enter upon the present route and location of said pipe from time to time for the purpose of mending and repairing said pipe
2 CONC  or any part or portion thereof for the purpose of laying down and ---- other or new pipe in line of the present pipe of the same size or any part or portion  thereof, said Theodore Terry his heirs and assigns to pay said Mix his 
