1 OCCU Edward and his brother were famous potters that moved into North Carolina (Fayetville and Seagrove) from Hartford Conn. See "Remarkable Potters of Seagrove" https://books.google.com/books?id=NthPuwkB4xAC&pg=PA22&lpg=PA22&dq=edward
