1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Potter who possibly trained under the tutelage of his uncle McCloud Webster. He and his older brother Chester Webster moved to what’s now known as Fayetteville NC in 1819. See screenshot from CrockerFarm.com that is uploaded to An
2 CONC cestry. Moved from Connecticut to Randolph County NC with his brothers Chester and Timothy. Moved from Randolph County NC to Marion County between 1830 and 1840 based on census information.  
