3 CITY Otsego
3 STAE Michigan
3 CTRY United States
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sabra Russell Trumbull (1818-1887) was a daughter of James Trumbull & Jane Watson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sabra Russell (Trumbull) White Hager Allen
2 CONT
2 CONT Sabra was three times left a widow. She was born in Connecticut. She met her first husband in New York state. She and her family came to Allegan County from NY in 1852 and settled in Otsego.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 1st - JOSIAH W. WHITE on March 24, 1836 in New York and when he died was left a widow with two children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT William H. White (1840-1862)
2 CONT John Trumbull White (1844-1923)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 2nd - PHINEAS A. HAGER on November 11, 1858 in Allegan Co., Mich. He was killed in 1864 in Atlanta, Georgia during the Civil War. Phineas was a 1st Sergeant in Company B, 19th Michigan Infantry.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 3rd - WILLIAM ALLEN on April 14, 1870 in Allegan Co., Mich. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial next to Josiah White in Mountain Home Cemetery, Otsego, Allegan County, MI.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/154398549/sabra-russell-allen
