2 CONT Federal Military Pension Applications-Pension Document Packet (NATF 85) Ambrose H. Palmer  Federal Military Pension Applications-Pension Document Packet (NATF 85) Ambrose H. Palmer  National Archives and Records Administration  Y 
2 CONC  Y Cert 105673  0  Lucinda is the twin sister of Lucina Westover Palmer Taylor.
2 CONT === GEDCOM Source ===
2 CONT Olmstead Co. Death records  Olmstead Co. Death records  Y  Y Book D page 89  0
2 CONT === GEDCOM Source ===
2 CONT Rochester Post and Record  Rochester Post and Record  Y  Y Feb 3, 1899, page 7, col. 4  0
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Died of Typhoid Fever Birthdate caluclated from twin sisters death record Birth recorded in Mother's Pension Application for her son Ambrose H. Palmer who died at Chickamauga in Sept 1863. This pension application includes a state
2 CONC mentt from Lucinda Gardiner attesting to the fact that she was present at the marriage of Lucina Taylor (then Westover) to Harvey Palmer. This proves she was a Westover and along with the obit that stated her twin sister from Roch
2 CONC ester attended, appearsto confirm her placement in the family of Calvin and Rebecca Westover.
2 CONT === GEDCOM Source ===
2 CONT Federal Military Pension Applications-Pension Document Packet (NATF 85) Ambrose H. Palmer  Federal Military Pension Applications-Pension Document Packet (NATF 85) Ambrose H. Palmer  National Archives and Records Administration  Y 
