2 CONT
2 CONT Calvin was born probably in Tompkins County NY in the town of Dryden inabout 1845. Calvin's father Calvin, was on the NY census in 1840 at thislocation. The numbers of people and their ages tend to match up withCalvin jr's sibling
2 CONC s and possibly his wife Harriet. Between 1847 whentheir daugther Harriet was born in NY and 1850 when they were located onthe WI census, they migrated west. Calvin and Harriet and his parents andsiblings. According to the 1850 cen
2 CONC sus, Calvin had two sisters and onebrother. all appearing to be born in NY.
