2 CONT
2 CONT Updated: 2006-03-07    Contact: Leah Pearson and her family at email: geofiles@aol.com 
2 CONT
2 CONT 	Horace Westover (Hannah Hopkins1) was born ABT. 1805 in Canada, and died ABT. 1851. He married Catherine Dennis Rodman. She was born 1803-1808.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Horace Westover and Catherine Dennis Rodman are:
2 CONT
2 CONT +	16	  i.	Mary Ann Westover was born 15 Aug 1826 in Elgin, Ontario, Canada, and died 15 Nov 1892 in Butman, Gladwin, Michigan.
2 CONT
2 CONT +	17	  ii.	William Henry Westover was born ABT. 1827 in Ontario, Canada, and died 24 Oct 1909 in Butman, Gladwin, Michigan.
2 CONT
2 CONT +	18	  iii.	Elizabeth Westover was born 6 Jan 1831 in Ontario, Canada, and died 6 Jul 1901 in Bayham Township, Elgin, Ontario, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT +	19	  iv.	Lyman Westover was born ABT. 1832 in Ontario, Canada, and died ABT. 1829 in Ontario, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT  	20	  v.	Rebecca Westover was born ABT. 1837 in Ontario, Canada, and died 9 May 1919 in Stratfordville, Malahide Twp., Elgin, Ontario, Canada. She married Lorenzo D. Hendershot. He died 23 Aug 1897. She married Thomas Frost.
2 CONT
2 CONT +	21	  vi.	Philinda Westover was born Oct 1839 in Malahide Twp, Elgin, Ontario, Canada, and died 1895 in Lapeer County, Michigan.
2 CONT
2 CONT +	22	  vii.	Lucinda Westover was born 1 Mar 1840 in Bayham, Elgin, Ontario, Canada, and died AFT. 1891.
2 CONT
2 CONT  	23	  viii.	Catherine Westover was born 1 Mar 1840 in Malahide, Elgin, Ontario, Canada. She married Thomas Kilmer 27 Jan 1862 in Malahide, Elgin, Ontario, Canada. He was born ABT. 1823, and died 3 Feb 1870.
2 CONT
2 CONT +	24	  ix.	Horace Wesley Westover was born 1 Mar 1840 in Bayham Township, Elgin, Ontario, Canada, and died 2 Mar 1891 in Butman, Gladwin, Michigan.
2 CONT
2 CONT +	25	  x.	Jacob Maitland Westover was born Sep 1842 in Dereham, Oxford, Ontario, Canada, and died 8 Nov 1909 in Philadelphia, PA.
2 CONT
2 CONT  	26	  xi.	Joseph Martin Westover was born 1846 in Ontario, Canada. 
2 CONT
2 CONT =====================================================
2 CONT
2 CONT obituary: Gladwin County Record 13 Mar 1891
2 CONT
2 CONT    --- The funeral of Horace Westover in Butman, Wednesday, was attended by Mr. and Mrs. John McCormick, Mr. and Mrs. P. S. Matthews, S. S. Townsend, George Keidan, Walter Black, J. W. Hendrie, D. O. R. Knowlton and David Jones of
2 CONC  this place, as representatives of Gladwin lodge I. O. O. F.
