1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Old Willimantic Cemetery
2 CONT
2 CONT Willimantic, Windham County, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT West Main Street (Rt. 6)
2 CONT
2 CONT Willimantic CT
2 CONT
2 CONT Lat: 41° 42' 54"N, Lon: 72° 13' 59"W
2 CONT
2 CONT The Old Willimantic Cemetery was founded in June of 1829 when land was purchased from Henry and Joseph Brown. As the town grew, additions were made to the cemetery. Years passed and it became neglected. The Windham Historical Soci
2 CONC ety has formed a restoration committee and they have been working to have it and other historical cemeteries in the Windham area restored.
2 CONT
2 CONT This is not a complete listing of burials! The records below were provided by contributors to Cemetery Records Online. Last edited Sep 22, 2005. Total records = 202.
