2 CONT Life sketch≤p>Kinner HOLLISTER II, son of Isaac & Ruth (Winchell) Hollister, b. Olive, Ulster Co., NY, 4 Nov., 1803; died Sept. 11, 1889. Minister, old school Baptist and farmer, Caroline Depot. ≤/p>≤p>Married Sarah Ann Cooper, bo
2 CONC rn Oct. 21, 1810  d. April 11, 1909, (per death cert.) daughter of Charles & Betsey (North) Cooper.  She was living with her daughter Almira Stevens in 1910 in Ithaca, NY.≤/p>≤p>In 1892 Sarah A. Hollister wife of Kinner is living 
2 CONC with Horace Hollister, with his sisters living next door. ≤/p>≤p>Both are buried in the Hollister Family Burial Plot≤/p>
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Alternate name:≤p>Kinner≤/p>
