2 CONT Middlebury Register from Middlebury, Vermont · Page 7 Sept 29 1911:
2 CONT Mrs. Delia Landon, wife of Charles Landon, died at her home on Case street on Saturday evening at the age of 89 years. Funeral services were held at her late home on Monday afternoon at 3 o'clock. Rev. John Evans Bold ofliciated. 
2 CONC The burial was in the family lot in Case street cemetery. She is survived by a husband and three sons, Charles Landon, jr., Theodore of Middlebury and I Dr. Edgar Landon of Stamford, N.
