2 CONT
2 CONT Eliza Phelps was the daughter of Spencer Phelps 1782 and Mary Kenneippe. Her parents moved to Leroy, Lake County, Ohio about 1807 from Northampton, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John W Reynolds on May 24, 1831 in Leroy, Lake, Ohio. The couple lived in Concord and Little Mountain in Lake County, Ohio. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Amanda 1833-1850,
2 CONT
2 CONT Lewis 1835, married Marceline R, lived in Cleveland, Ohio, one child Charles,
2 CONT
2 CONT William R 1837-1929, married Mary L Stafford and Sarah E Stafford, lived in Concord and Mentor, Lake County, Ohio, seven children,
2 CONT
2 CONT Mortimer L 1841, married Josephine Tyler, lived in Concord, Lake, Ohio, three children,
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry 1843, married Emma L Manchester, lived in Chardon, Geauga, Ohio and Mentor, Lake, Ohio, one child,
2 CONT
2 CONT Lucy P 1849-1850,
2 CONT
2 CONT Simeon 1851-1856,
2 CONT
2 CONT Eliza 1853-1863,
2 CONT
2 CONT John W 1858, married Sadie M Gooch, lived in Concord, Lake, Ohio, four children.
