2 CONC e Avenue Cemetery, Bristol, CT are: Arthur Terry Fletcher (B-4/15/1898, D-8/15/1992);  Eleanor Inez (Beckwith) Fletcher (B-2/16/1900, D-2/4/1986);  Fred Stanton Fletcher (B-2/16/1872, D-1/28/1963);  Isabelle Webster (Terry) Fletch
