2 CONT Northerly:  By land of William Dailey, et al;  Easterly:  By Middle Street;  Southerly:  By other land of the heirs of Franklin E. Terry; and Westerly:  By other land of the heirs of Franklin E. Terry.
2 CONT Appraised @  $1,000.
