2 CONT Northerly:  By land of William Dailey et al and other land of the heirs of Franklin E. Terry;  Easterly:  By Middle Street;  Southerly:  By other land of the heirs of Franklin E. Terry and by South Street; and by land of Arthur Fl
2 CONC etcher; and Westerly:  By land of The Fletcher Terry Company and by land of Arthur Fletcher and by South Street.
