1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I found this photo in Robert Merrill's geni.com entry for William Albert.  Robert is descended from Frank Forest Merrill, son of Albert Forest Merrill and his probable first wife, Ellen Oliver.  I say probable, bec
2 CONC ause there was an infant, Ida O. Merrill, who died in about 1869 at the age of fifteen months; on the death certificate, her parents were named as Albert Merrill and Eliza Merrill.  It's possible that it was mistranscribed from El
2 CONC len, or that Ellen's middle or other name was Eliza as well.  At any rate, in the following year, 1870, Ellen and Albert were listed in the Long Rapids census, so it seems likely that the "Eliza" was really Ellen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Also of curiosity, however, was an 1859 letter from Albert's family about one of his brothers, who was married to a girl in Fremont (later Long Rapids), noting that Albert had been married there as well in 1859.  They lived in Nor
2 CONC thumberland County, Ontario, so weren't really "in the loop", so to speak, about their sons'/brothers' goings-on.  So I don't know if Albert was married four times (once by 1859, once for Ida O. in 1869, once by 1870 to Ellen, and
2 CONC  once to Mary Thompson in 1876); it could be that there were two wives, however:  once to Ellen by 1859, and another time to Mary.  Need to get this straightened out.  
2 CONT
2 CONT If it were not for Robert (and our Alpena family:  Chris, Sandy, and Ray),  Judy Oberto (whose mother-in-law was doing research on the Merrill family in the 1930s!), Connie McCann-Wilkes, and Howard and Jean Merrill, none of this 
2 CONC information would be possible.  All of the contributors will be credited by the end of these notes.
2 CONT
2 CONT In the photograph above, William Albert Merrill (son of Albert Forest Merrill and Mary Thompson) is at the top right.  Alex, half-brother to William Albert (by his mother, Mary Thompson, and her second husband, Martin LeRoy) is on
2 CONC  the top left.  Frank Forest Merrill, William's half-brother by his father and his first wife, Ellen Oliver) is on the bottom left; John Merrill, brother of William by his mother (Mary Thompson) and father (Albert Forest Merrill).
2 CONC   John was the second child in the family by that name.  First was a twin of Minnie Merrill.  More to follow.
2 CONT
2 CONT More following:-)
2 CONT
